# Leg Day
unit: kg
description: Quads, hamstrings, and glutes.

Squat | reps 4x6 | 80 | rest 2m30s
Romanian Deadlift | reps 3x10 | 60 | rest 1m30s
Leg Press | reps 3x12 | 120 | rest 1m30s
Walking Lunge | reps 3x12 | 16 | rest 1m
Leg Curl (Machine) | reps 3x12 | 35 | rest 1m
Calf Raise | reps 4x15 | 40 | rest 45s
